Hints for working on these hooks.

manual-not-found is generated from manual-not-found.in.

Rebuild with

$ make -C .. info-hooks-default/manual-not-found

You can test the hooks by running from the command line,
e.g. "./manual-not-found foo".

To test, the files need to be accessible via the XDG config dirs.
For example, you could do:

$ mkdir -p ~/.config/texinfo/info-hooks/
$ cd ~/.config/texinfo/info-hooks/
$ ln -sf -t . $texinfo_git_checkout/info/info-hooks-default/*

where $texinfo_git_checkout is the directory name of the Texinfo sources.

"info -x 1" prints some messages on stderr about hook searching.
